-- הסכם אופק חדש (25.12.2008), §159 ועדת היגוי: a parity steering committee
-- of the Treasury's wages division, the Ministry and the union helps
-- interpret and apply the agreement; it meets within 14 days of either
-- side's request, and decides unanimously.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

§ `159 ועדת היגוי`

DECLARE `section 159 action` IS ONE OF `convene the steering committee`

@ref akn:art_159__para_a akn:art_159__para_b
`the steering committee's members` MEANS
    LIST `the wages commissioner at the Treasury`, `the Ministry of Education`, `the teachers' union`

-- (ג): within 14 days of a party's request.
@ref akn:art_159__para_c
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `section 159 action`
DECIDE `convening the steering committee` IS
    PARTY `the steering committee`
    MUST  `convene the steering committee`
    WITHIN 14
    LEST BREACH BY `the steering committee` BECAUSE "section 159(ג): the committee meets within 14 days of a request"

-- (ד): unanimously.
@ref akn:art_159__para_d
GIVEN votes IS A LIST OF BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the steering committee decides` votes IF
    (NOT null votes) AND all (GIVEN v YIELD v) votes

#ASSERT NOT `the steering committee decides` (LIST TRUE, TRUE, FALSE)

#TRACE `convening the steering committee` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the steering committee` DOES `convene the steering committee` AT 14
